+	/*
+	 * Unlocked is not enough. Read the mode-detect totals: a wedged chip
+	 * reports implausible geometry (the 4.1x clock signature), while a
+	 * merely idle input reports zeros. Only the former is repairable by
+	 * a reset, and only the former is worth the cost of one.
